sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as Spark Controller<br/>8080/TCP metrics
    participant Driver as Spark Driver Pod
    participant Executor as Spark Executor Pods
    participant SparkConnect as SparkConnect Server<br/>15002/TCP gRPC
    participant Platform as rhods-operator
    participant ModuleCtrl as Module Controller

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Controller: Flow 1: SparkApplication Submission
        User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkApplication CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (RBAC)
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-sparkapplication<br/>TLS 1.2+, K8s API auth
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated + defaulted
        K8sAPI-->>User: CR created

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch (informer)<br/>ServiceAccount token
        Note over Controller: State: New -> Submitted
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Pod<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate--v1-pod<br/>TLS 1.2+, K8s API auth
        Note over Webhook: Injects: volumes, env,<br/>sidecars, GPU, scheduling,<br/>security contexts
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated pod spec
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Service, Ingress,<br/>PDB, ConfigMap
        Note over Controller: State: Submitted -> Running
        Driver->>Executor: Spawn executor pods
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch executor pod phases
        Note over Controller: State: Running -> Completed/Failed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,SparkConnect: Flow 2: SparkConnect Server Lifecycle
        User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkConnect CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-sparkconnect<br/>TLS 1.2+
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated + defaulted
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap, Pod, Service<br/>ServiceAccount token
        Note over SparkConnect: Ports: 7078, 7079,<br/>4040, 15002/gRPC
        User->>SparkConnect: gRPC connect<br/>15002/TCP<br/>NetworkPolicy: workbench labels
        SparkConnect->>Executor: TCP 7078/7079<br/>Same namespace
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Platform,ModuleCtrl: Flow 3: Platform Module Lifecycle
        Platform->>K8sAPI: Create SparkOperator CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
        ModuleCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch (informer)<br/>ServiceAccount token
        ModuleCtrl->>K8sAPI: Server-side apply<br/>workload operator manifests<br/>ServiceAccount token
    end
